# /check-crm-history

Generalizes Topwater's `/check-affinity-contact` and
`/check-affinity-history`. Runs before any outreach draft is created, so no
{{vocabulary.entity}} ever gets contacted twice by accident.

---

## What this skill does

For each {{vocabulary.entity}} about to receive outreach, query every
configured `crm` connector with `crmRead` capability
({{connectors.crm}}) for prior contact or interaction history. This is a
**live read**, not a cached one — per
`standards/OUTPUT-STANDARDS.md` Rule O4's own exception list, a CRM history
check is one of the two skill types whose entire output is a live read of
an external system, where a day-old answer is a different answer. Reuse
only within the same calendar day, and state the time of the read whenever
this skill's output is reused within that window.
